{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>台灣女星朱寶意（Emily）當年憑電影《英雄本色》飾演張國榮女友Jackie一角紅透半邊天，憑標緻甜美的樣貌成功俘虜不少男士的心，其清純脫俗的形象至今仍令無數影迷心動。不過朱寶意在90年代中突然絕跡幕前，息影後非常低調，直至近年不時在微博分享日常生活。昨日（2日）朱寶意更新社交平台，分享了與女兒的慶生照，其凍齡狀態驚艷不少網民。</p><figure><img alt=\"當年她憑着標緻甜美的樣子成功俘虜了不少少男的心。（劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200808/368810819691089920.jpeg/bd_rQQ0OJpiUu1uqFOPv1fDtfkm8gkVbgjopgoI6KYI\"/><figcaption>當年她憑着標緻甜美的樣子成功俘虜了不少少男的心。（劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱寶意（Emily）當年憑電影《英雄本色》飾演張國榮女友Jackie一角紅透半邊天。（微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194269160092209152907243.jpeg/BzgzVlk9CPXMSjlX-6Yk3gXCQWfeN_Pcg2QHrYNkB60\"/><figcaption>朱寶意（Emily）當年憑電影《英雄本色》飾演張國榮女友Jackie一角紅透半邊天。（微博）</figcaption></figure><p>朱寶意66歲風采依然</p><p>朱寶意於日前（10月31日）迎來66歲生日，愛女恩慈特別為母親慶祝。從朱寶意在社交平台分享的合照可見，留著一頭清爽短髮的她身穿黑色透視閃片上衣，皮膚緊緻之餘，身材亦保養得宜，多年來樣貌都沒有太大分別，風采依然，凍齡力非常驚人。由於朱寶意生日適逢萬聖節，她與女兒戴上充滿節日氣氛的萬聖節南瓜與骷髏魔女頭飾，捧著寫上「Happy Birthday」字樣的蛋糕慶祝，畫面溫馨。</p><figure><img alt=\"朱寶意於日前（10月31日）迎來66歲生日，愛女恩慈特別為母親慶祝。（IG/@emilychu1031）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194271089556066304803251.jpeg/9L8OUxhqIK9jaC_rBQycqLF4cTnw5giyqNS_e6jUv3s\"/><figcaption>朱寶意於日前（10月31日）迎來66歲生日，愛女恩慈特別為母親慶祝。（IG/@emilychu1031）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱寶意凍齡力驚人風采依然。（IG/@emilychu1031）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194271086531842048491328.jpeg/zGhpXXrCiyYWKw8hQ5942B8Ci-KytBi9F87yDBfO8gw\"/><figcaption>朱寶意凍齡力驚人風采依然。（IG/@emilychu1031）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朱寶意無論身形及樣貌都保養得宜。（IG/@emilychu1031）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194275400059064320360827.jpeg/ajx70obb2vmvTun7wGmKHgO_Zq_BIGVPCHrppAh66aQ\"/><figcaption>朱寶意無論身形及樣貌都保養得宜。（IG/@emilychu1031）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"完全唔似66歲！（IG/@emilychu1031）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194275397185835008172368.jpeg/rbay6ihmtLAe4uW_DSmbPEFNtE4AXh3U_3O9gP9zvYA\"/><figcaption>完全唔似66歲！（IG/@emilychu1031）</figcaption></figure><p>朱寶意女兒遺傳神級美貌</p><p>朱寶意的女兒遺傳了媽媽的完美基因，五官精緻深邃，身形高䠷，非常有氣質。女兒恩慈與母親同樣熱愛藝術，現時身兼平面設計師及模特兒，曾為多個國際品牌拍攝廣告，表現力同辨識度都十分高，個性十足的她完美Carry不同造型，事業發展不俗。</p><figure><img alt=\"朱寶意的女兒遺傳了媽媽的完美基因，五官精緻深邃，身形高䠷，非常有氣質。（IG/@salusliang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194275691684827136086124.jpeg/azXFhYFnQFV6A47SMgmQZqkoR1v6SBrS0auyq9Grsqs\"/><figcaption>朱寶意的女兒遺傳了媽媽的完美基因，五官精緻深邃，身形高䠷，非常有氣質。（IG/@salusliang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"女兒恩慈與母親同樣熱愛藝術，現時身兼平面設計師及模特兒，曾為多個國際品牌拍攝廣告。（IG/@salusliang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194275689184890880384019.jpeg/WSxhOoy0AiY0w6hBRAu8PWBkIdiNu8ljFZ-ASBWfgEg\"/><figcaption>女兒恩慈與母親同樣熱愛藝術，現時身兼平面設計師及模特兒，曾為多個國際品牌拍攝廣告。（IG/@salusliang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身形高䠷。（IG@salusliang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533378286986727424517089.jpeg/Ql5rXYA6JbexQ_OxKmfVl0WRleN59D9Ka90NfGvdDXw\"/><figcaption>身形高䠷。（IG@salusliang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"五官深邃立體。（IG@salusliang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533378173497249792645319.jpeg/LqX5P5rjdSENz-y495-mg2JI2-qJejpwFTWmLhU1pi4\"/><figcaption>五官深邃立體。（IG@salusliang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身形高䠷。（IG@salusliang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533378175640670208409173.jpeg/5PZVF1dJnZIbk8a8GvRLInJ7XA5yalT0g_o7mIP6O5g\"/><figcaption>身形高䠷。（IG@salusliang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾為多個國際品牌拍攝廣告。（微博@朱寶意Emily）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374419129602048754310.jpeg/RWZTOB3r6QiPD6vQ3Gd0gXtKY9wBEWIO4RbzJeEW8yU\"/><figcaption>曾為多個國際品牌拍攝廣告。（微博@朱寶意Emily）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾為多個國際品牌拍攝廣告。（微博@朱寶意Emily）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374421369491456075216.jpeg/pg-iQoDhGkJ_5-kUYDlP_MQx-3ynSnmRn92w4Z_dsOE\"/><figcaption>曾為多個國際品牌拍攝廣告。（微博@朱寶意Emily）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"曾為多個國際品牌拍攝廣告。（微博@朱寶意Emily）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374423668101120935416.jpeg/yApPi54I-pOmfAqDf__b1MBdeR1TRYTIhN6XfITel3w\"/><figcaption>曾為多個國際品牌拍攝廣告。（微博@朱寶意Emily）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"個性十足。（微博@SALUS恩慈）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374787888615424218974.jpeg/OBMXP4j_N_3eYkoWkk0KR9DLDR2hwIMwFPAlkRTwJZE\"/><figcaption>個性十足。（微博@SALUS恩慈）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辨識度高。（微博@THEYKNOW_offical）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374799033536512542763.jpeg/pf_JBPRD43zAIUTSWbFKsNdCKkCUdVjYDfswtg37MLY\"/><figcaption>辨識度高。（微博@THEYKNOW_offical）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辨識度高。（微博@THEYKNOW_offical）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374801361506304398170.jpeg/MDmv-b_t0hiYclKCs-YDStkyfHlTvN3XfMUqrnzFKq4\"/><figcaption>辨識度高。（微博@THEYKNOW_offical）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"辨識度高。（微博@THEYKNOW_offical）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374796659429376173025.jpeg/NEm6cBcIcBBF9R2UqSmh8BQvaO99MoOpmuPaJJrj2iQ\"/><figcaption>辨識度高。（微博@THEYKNOW_offical）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"完美Carry不同造型。（微博@SALUS恩慈）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374790153670656764532.jpeg/xSHb8zZbdQNnwqOU5UUOW4DBRk9hUbZQj2Szg49ks4M\"/><figcaption>完美Carry不同造型。（微博@SALUS恩慈）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"完美Carry不同造型。（微博@SALUS恩慈）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374792171261952038246.jpeg/lH4P-nz5tdOqXpfXpdRmtlEK1NadTVZQdTydGnU8nRo\"/><figcaption>完美Carry不同造型。（微博@SALUS恩慈）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"笑容甜美。（微博@朱寶意Emily）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374426121900032756349.jpeg/YCTWSWYvTx74JufFBfpjutgBwXhydBtwQXzBq0F8was\"/><figcaption>笑容甜美。（微博@朱寶意Emily）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"為Calvin Klein拍廣告。（微博@朱寶意Emily）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20211105/533374432921260032801963.jpeg/mU91N7YVIPqNpe-sekYVvdk1DPI7VJx3eE4JSHhOCUg\"/><figcaption>為Calvin Klein拍廣告。（微博@朱寶意Emily）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:33.759186+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1166,"images":22,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:30:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:44.973668+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:39:03.408893+00:00","content_hash":"d5e90b523ee7951d33503f3d475326fff44c329ec21bd5c521b63abe6fc07bb9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}